     [38;5;246mEmail plus password, sessions, reset flow. Most work, least of it related to tasks or notifications. Worth it only
[39m     [38;5;246mif this faces people you don't trust.[39m
  [38;5;246m4.[39m OAuth (Google/GitHub)
     [38;5;246mDelegate identity to a provider. Little auth code, real accounts, and profile data for free; adds a provider [39m
